            question: "9. Does only space hardware need thermal vacuum testing?",
            answer: "No. High-altitude avionics, UAV and HAPS payloads, sensor and seeker assemblies, vacuum-exposed scientific instruments and some industrial processes are tested the same way — usually to different standards and less demanding vacuum levels, but for the same underlying reason. In India this group is currently larger than the satellite group.",
